# Per-run pipeline outputs (BAM/VCF/index) under revision/.
# ~946 MB and fully regenerable: each run.sh reproduces its own results/ from
# the fixed inputs in data/. The scientifically meaningful artifacts — run.sh,
# meta.json, score.json, raw_response.txt, raw_thinking.txt, exec.log — are
# tracked. Drop this rule and re-add if the per-cell outputs are ever wanted.
revision/runs/*/*/results/
revision/runs_ablation/*/*/results/
revision/runs_ablation_discarded/*/*/results/
revision/runs_oldconfig/*/*/results/
